    "body": "## Description\r\n\r\nThis pull request adds BOLT12 support to coco as a first-class payment method for mint and melt operations. It integrates BOLT12 into the quote lifecycle, operation APIs, handlers, watchers, adapters, React hooks, docs, and tests while preserving coco’s method-agnostic architecture.\r\n\r\nThis pull request resolves #160 \r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\ncoco previously handled quote and operation flows around assumptions that were largely compatible with BOLT11: fixed positive quote amounts, one quote mapping to one operation, and generic quote state propagation.\r\n\r\nBOLT12 introduces different semantics, especially reusable offers and amountless mint flows. After upstream quote handling moved into `QuoteLifecycle`, the initial BOLT12 implementation needed to be realigned so BOLT12 behavior lived in method handlers and operation services instead of leaking method-specific assumptions into generic quote lifecycle code.\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\n- Added BOLT12 mint and melt handlers, including BOLT12 offer support, method registration, manager wiring, and subscription support.\r\n- Refactored shared melt behavior into a base bolt melt handler so BOLT11 and BOLT12 can share common melt logic without duplicating protocol flow.\r\n- Updated `QuoteLifecycle` so generic quote handling can pass method data into handlers and no longer enforces BOLT11-only assumptions globally.\r\n- Added support for BOLT12 reusable and amountless mint quotes, including explicit operation amounts when preparing from an existing reusable quote.\r\n- Updated mint operation tracking so one reusable quote can safely map to multiple local operations.\r\n- Updated mint watchers and processors so reusable quote updates only process operations that have individually been observed as paid.\r\n- Added `listByQuote()` APIs for mint and melt operations to support multiple operations associated with the same quote.\r\n- Updated React operation hooks to use structured quote lookup input and expose quote-based operation listing.\r\n- Updated persistence schemas and repositories to support BOLT12 operation requirements and duplicate quote-id safe persistence.\r\n- Added docs for BOLT12 minting and melting flows.\r\n- Added unit and integration coverage for BOLT12 handlers, quote APIs, operation services, watchers, processors, and React hooks.\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' build`\r\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' test:unit`\r\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' typecheck`\r\n\r\nFull workspace typecheck was also attempted, but it still fails on an unrelated existing sqlite resolution issue for `@cashu/cashu-ts`.\r\n\r\n## Changeset\r\n\r\n- Added `.changeset/bright-bolt12-offers.md`\r\n- Marks `@cashu/coco-core` as minor and adapter/React packages as patch releases.",
