    "body": "## Summary\n- Rebase the PR 182 BOLT12 stack onto `feat/onchain` while preserving the contributor-authored commits.\n- Align BOLT12 mint with reusable canonical quote semantics shared with onchain, including capability-driven auto-claim behavior.\n- Keep BOLT12 melt support and add a follow-up issue document for extracting reusable mint claiming from `MintOperationService`.\n\n## Verification\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' typecheck`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' build`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' test -- test/unit/MintBolt12Handler.test.ts test/unit/MeltBolt12Handler.test.ts`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' test -- test/unit/MintOperationService.test.ts`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' test -- test/unit/MintOperationWatcherService.test.ts`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' test -- test/unit/MintQuoteProcessor.test.ts test/unit/MintOpsApi.test.ts test/unit/MeltOpsApi.test.ts`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-core' test -- test/unit/QuoteApi.test.ts`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-react' lint`\n- `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-react' typecheck`\n- `bun run docs:build`\n- `cd packages/sqlite3 && bun run test -- src/test/schema.test.ts src/test/contract.test.ts src/test/MintOperationRepository.test.ts src/test/MeltOperationRepository.test.ts src/test/SendOperationRepository.test.ts --reporter verbose`\n\n## Notes\n- Full `bun run --filter='@cashu/coco-sqlite' test` was not run to completion because `src/test/integration.test.ts` requires `MINT_URL`. The non-network sqlite repository/schema coverage passes.",
